

# type(scope): summary in the imperative, lowercase, no period
#
# Types: feat, fix, refactor, perf, test, style, docs, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scopes: cities, planner, converter, home, legal, ui, i18n, seo, settings,
#         server, contact, data, deps, lint (optional)
#
# Examples:
#   feat(converter): restore the link on back and forward
#   fix(server): keep the query string in language redirects
#   ci: run checks and build on GitHub Actions
#
# Body (after a blank line): why the change was made, what to know.
# Breaking change: "feat(seo)!: …" or a "BREAKING CHANGE: …" line.
